posts.body:
Eli can speak as to whether his plugin does anything unexpected in this regard.
Generally speaking, all you need to do is paste the below into a text editor, save as a *.js file, and include as a plugin at the top of your plugin manager list.
Code:
ImageManager.faceWidth = 192;
ImageManager.faceHeight = 164;
However, keep in mind that it may screw up the formatting of any windows where the faces are displayed.
